<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!-- ==================================================================
       ==================== 世代化彈體（老式／先進）====================
       ==================================================================
       在同一套「四階 sizeClass」下，為每一階補上一個「老式」與一個「先進」彈體，
       中間夾著原本的現役彈體（Ballistic / Cruise / Light / Loiter）。

       命名對照（彈體 defName ← 現實參考型號 ← 對應發射平台）：
         DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyLoiter       ← V1（Fi 103，脈衝噴射巡飛彈）← 旋轉發射架／軌道發射架
         DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyBallistic    ← V2（A4，液態燃料彈道火箭）← 塔式發射架／戰略導彈發射井
         DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyInterceptor  ← 萊茵女兒（Rheintochter）← 旋轉發射架／軌道發射架
         DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedLight      ← 地獄火（AGM-114） ← 輕型導彈
         DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedBallistic  ← 民兵三型（LGM-30G）← 彈道導彈發射井
         DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedCruise     ← 戰斧（BGM-109）   ← 輕型（小型）導彈

       三代裝備體系（docs/三代裝備體系_實作計畫.md §4）新增的彈體也放在本檔：
         DMSE_MissileBody_Stinger   ← 刺針（FIM-92）    ← 輕型攔截彈／單兵發射具彈藥
         DMSE_MissileBody_Maverick  ← 小牛（AGM-65）    ← 輕型對地彈
         DMSE_MissileBody_Sparrow   ← 麻雀（AIM-7）     ← 輕型半主動攔截彈
         DMSE_MissileBody_Moskit    ← 白蛉（P-270）     ← 中型反艦彈
         DMSE_MissileBody_Yj        ← 鷹擊（YJ-12 級）  ← 中型高超音速反艦彈
         DMSE_MissileBody_Tochka    ← 圓點U（9K79-1）   ← 彈道階，塔／井內裝配

       世代只影響數值與成本，不新增 MissileSizeClass 列舉值。
       平台實際能裝什麼由建築的 storage filter 決定；MissileLauncherExtension 的
       sizeClass／extraSizeClasses 與 filter 的一致性由 .source/Tools/check_missile_content.py 檢查。

       本檔同時提供每個彈體專屬的 incoming skyfaller（落點視覺），
       貼圖：1.7/Textures/Things/Missile/<型號>/skyFaller_incoming.png（缺圖的型號暫借相近型號，見計畫 §15）。
       離場 skyfaller 由發射平台（CompProperties_MissileRailLauncher.skyfaller）指定，不在彈體上。

       可達路徑：
         - Ballistic 四種（LegacyBallistic／Tochka／Ballistic／AdvancedBallistic）都可在塔式發射架與
           戰略導彈發射井的彈體選單切換，研究門檻見各彈體的 researchPrerequisites；
           DMSE_BallisticMissile.xml 的 9 個部件同時列入這四種彈體。
         - 物品型彈體由對應物品的 CompMissileConfig.defaultBody 使用；
           固定構型物品（V1、萊茵女兒、白蟻）以 DMSE.MissileItemExtension 宣告彈體。
         - 只有**物品型態**、且有槽位的彈體帶 defaultParts：該物品建造時自帶一組零件，
           材料已含在它的 costList；彈道彈體在發射井上裝配，井／架建造完成是空的。
       ================================================================== -->


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       一、老式彈道導彈（V2）— 彈道階，塔式發射架／戰略導彈發射井內直接裝配
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <DMSE.MissileBodyDef>
    <defName>DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyBallistic</defName>
    <label>legacy ballistic missile body</label>
    <description>A first-generation ballistic rocket in the mould of the V-2: a liquid-fuelled airframe with a mechanical inertial platform and radio lateral correction and no true terminal guidance, slow to prepare and wildly inaccurate by modern standards, devoting most of its mass to structure and propellant but able to be assembled in a silo out of industrial stock long before real strategic systems exist.</description>
    <sizeClass>Ballistic</sizeClass>
    <!-- 與現役彈道彈體相同：只能垂直發射、在發射架上直接裝配（無物品型態） -->
    <launchMode>Vertical</launchMode>
    <customizeLocation>Launcher</customizeLocation>
    <!-- N = 5：老式裝藥效率差，效果強度低於現役彈道（N=8）與先進彈道（N=9） -->
    <payloadCapacity>5</payloadCapacity>
    <baseExplosionRadius>6</baseExplosionRadius>
    <baseDamageDef>Bomb</baseDamageDef>
    <baseDamageAmount>150</baseDamageAmount>
    <!-- 散布極大：純慣性、無終端修正，本來就是面殺傷武器 -->
    <baseScatter>7</baseScatter>
    <baseWorldSpeedFactor>0.9</baseWorldSpeedFactor>
    <!-- 射程：120 * 1.8 * 0.1 = 21.6 → 22 格（現役 45、先進 58） -->
    <baseRange>0</baseRange>
    <!-- 無導引能力：飛行中不做任何終端位置更新 -->
    <terminalUpdates>0</terminalUpdates>
    <baseFuel>120</baseFuel>
    <baseSpecificImpulse>1.8</baseSpecificImpulse>
    <rangePerFuelImpulse>0.1</rangePerFuelImpulse>
    <!-- 裝配工作量：零件少、工藝粗，遠低於現役（3600） -->
    <assembleWorkAmount>1800</assembleWorkAmount>
    <!-- 塔式發射架（DMSE_Ballistics）的預設彈體 -->
    <researchPrerequisites>
      <li>DMSE_Ballistics</li>
    </researchPrerequisites>
    <incomingSkyfaller>DMSE_Incoming_LegacyBallisticMissile</incomingSkyfaller>
    <launchProjectile>DMSE_Launch_LegacyBallistic</launchProjectile>
    <slots>
      <li>Warhead</li>
      <li>Guidance</li>
      <li>Payload</li>
    </slots>
  </DMSE.MissileBodyDef>


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       二、老式巡飛彈（V1）— 巡飛階，傾斜發射軌
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <DMSE.MissileBodyDef>
    <defName>DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyLoiter</defName>
    <label>legacy loitering munition</label>
    <description>A first-generation pulsejet loitering munition in the spirit of the V-1, rail-launched and flown by a clockwork inertial autopilot along a preset heading, slow and easy to detect with accuracy measured in neighbourhoods but needing only steel, fuel and a simple jet tube to be thrown at a target beyond the horizon, with nothing to configure: it is built, loaded onto the rail, and fired.</description>
    <sizeClass>Loitering</sizeClass>
    <launchMode>Tilt</launchMode>
    <!-- 與現役巡飛彈相同：無裝配槽，固定構型 -->
    <customizeLocation>None</customizeLocation>
    <baseExplosionRadius>4</baseExplosionRadius>
    <baseDamageDef>Bomb</baseDamageDef>
    <baseDamageAmount>90</baseDamageAmount>
    <baseScatter>6</baseScatter>
    <baseWorldSpeedFactor>0.75</baseWorldSpeedFactor>
    <!-- 射程：55 * 2.2 * 0.1 = 12.1 → 12 格（與現役巡飛彈同級） -->
    <baseRange>0</baseRange>
    <baseFuel>55</baseFuel>
    <baseSpecificImpulse>2.2</baseSpecificImpulse>
    <rangePerFuelImpulse>0.1</rangePerFuelImpulse>
    <incomingSkyfaller>DMSE_Incoming_LegacyLoiter</incomingSkyfaller>
    <launchProjectile>DMSE_Launch_LegacyLoiter</launchProjectile>
    <!-- 無 slots：不可自定義。 -->
    <!-- 無導引部件，但仍由操作員以無線電指令選點（與現役巡飛彈的電視制導同一個流程，
         只影響選目標，不提供跨圖層與終端更新）。 -->
    <builtInGuidance Class="DMSE.GuidanceType_TV" />
  </DMSE.MissileBodyDef>


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       三、老式攔截巡飛彈（萊茵女兒）— 巡飛階，發射後滯空待敵的攔截彈
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <DMSE.MissileBodyDef>
    <defName>DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyInterceptor</defName>
    <label>legacy interceptor loitering munition</label>
    <description>A first-generation guided interceptor loitering munition built around four oversized fins and a radio command link: it is launched to circle over the target area and only then dives on an incoming aircraft under an operator's command, slow, short-legged and only marginally accurate, yet a genuine guided interceptor in an age when anti-aircraft fire is still aimed by eye. It leaves the factory in a fixed configuration rather than being assembled per target.</description>
    <!-- 巡飛階：與巡飛彈發射軌／旋轉架的 sizeClass 相容；它不是輕型防空彈，而是滯空攔截彈 -->
    <sizeClass>Loitering</sizeClass>
    <!-- 巡飛平台是傾斜發射軌，沒有垂直發射單元 -->
    <launchMode>Tilt</launchMode>
    <!-- 戰備彈：不裝配、不逐目標配置（與 DMSE_InterceptorMissile 相同） -->
    <customizeLocation>None</customizeLocation>
    <baseExplosionRadius>3</baseExplosionRadius>
    <baseDamageDef>Bomb</baseDamageDef>
    <baseDamageAmount>55</baseDamageAmount>
    <baseScatter>5</baseScatter>
    <baseWorldSpeedFactor>0.7</baseWorldSpeedFactor>
    <!-- 射程：50 * 2 * 0.1 = 10 格 -->
    <baseRange>0</baseRange>
    <baseFuel>50</baseFuel>
    <baseSpecificImpulse>2</baseSpecificImpulse>
    <rangePerFuelImpulse>0.1</rangePerFuelImpulse>
    <incomingSkyfaller>DMSE_Incoming_LegacyInterceptor</incomingSkyfaller>
    <launchProjectile>DMSE_Launch_LegacyInterceptor</launchProjectile>
    <!-- 作為攔截彈時命中率 ×0.6：無線電指令導引、靠操作員肉眼，命中率令人沮喪。 -->
    <interceptHitFactor>0.6</interceptHitFactor>
    <!-- 無 slots：固定構型（連續桿／破片戰鬥部）。沒有導引槽也沒有 builtInGuidance，
         MissileConfig.HasTerminalGuidance 恆為 false，故不設 terminalUpdates。 -->
  </DMSE.MissileBodyDef>


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       四、先進通用導彈（地獄火）— 輕型階
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <DMSE.MissileBodyDef>
    <defName>DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedLight</defName>
    <label>advanced general-purpose missile body</label>
    <description>A compact multi-role airframe in the class of the Hellfire. Light enough for man-portable and vehicle racks, but with modern seekers, tight dispersion and a payload fraction the older light missiles never managed. Three assembly slots: warhead, guidance and payload.</description>
    <sizeClass>Light</sizeClass>
    <launchMode>Both</launchMode>
    <customizeLocation>Item</customizeLocation>
    <!-- N = 4：高於現役輕型（N=3），低於先進巡航（N=6） -->
    <payloadCapacity>4</payloadCapacity>
    <baseExplosionRadius>4.5</baseExplosionRadius>
    <baseDamageDef>Bomb</baseDamageDef>
    <baseDamageAmount>100</baseDamageAmount>
    <baseScatter>2</baseScatter>
    <baseWorldSpeedFactor>0.9</baseWorldSpeedFactor>
    <!-- 射程：80 * 2.8 * 0.1 = 22.4 → 22 格（現役輕型 17.5） -->
    <baseRange>0</baseRange>
    <terminalUpdates>2</terminalUpdates>
    <baseFuel>80</baseFuel>
    <baseSpecificImpulse>2.8</baseSpecificImpulse>
    <rangePerFuelImpulse>0.1</rangePerFuelImpulse>
    <assembleWorkAmount>900</assembleWorkAmount>
    <incomingSkyfaller>DMSE_Incoming_AdvancedLightMissile</incomingSkyfaller>
    <launchProjectile>DMSE_Launch_AdvancedLight</launchProjectile>
    <slots>
      <li>Warhead</li>
      <li>Guidance</li>
      <li>Payload</li>
    </slots>
    <!-- 建造時自帶：材料已含在物品 costList 內。 -->
    <defaultParts>
      <li>DMSE_AdvLight_Warhead_HEAT</li>
      <li>DMSE_AdvLight_Guidance_Inertial</li>
      <li>DMSE_AdvLight_Payload_None</li>
    </defaultParts>
  </DMSE.MissileBodyDef>


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       五、先進彈道導彈（民兵三型）— 彈道階，發射井內直接裝配
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <DMSE.MissileBodyDef>
    <defName>DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedBallistic</defName>
    <label>advanced ballistic missile body</label>
    <description>A modern silo-based strategic airframe in the class of the Minuteman III. Staged, lightweight and precisely guided, it lofts its bus to the edge of the atmosphere and puts a warhead on a specific building rather than a district. Assembled directly in the silo; the airframe never exists as an item.</description>
    <sizeClass>Ballistic</sizeClass>
    <launchMode>Vertical</launchMode>
    <customizeLocation>Launcher</customizeLocation>
    <!-- N = 9：全模組最高效果強度 -->
    <payloadCapacity>9</payloadCapacity>
    <baseExplosionRadius>9</baseExplosionRadius>
    <baseDamageDef>Bomb</baseDamageDef>
    <baseDamageAmount>240</baseDamageAmount>
    <baseScatter>4</baseScatter>
    <baseWorldSpeedFactor>1.7</baseWorldSpeedFactor>
    <!-- 射程：180 * 3.2 * 0.1 = 57.6 → 58 格 -->
    <baseRange>0</baseRange>
    <terminalUpdates>3</terminalUpdates>
    <baseFuel>180</baseFuel>
    <baseSpecificImpulse>3.2</baseSpecificImpulse>
    <rangePerFuelImpulse>0.1</rangePerFuelImpulse>
    <assembleWorkAmount>4200</assembleWorkAmount>
    <researchPrerequisites>
      <li>DMSE_StrategicSystems</li>
    </researchPrerequisites>
    <incomingSkyfaller>DMSE_Incoming_AdvancedBallisticMissile</incomingSkyfaller>
    <launchProjectile>DMSE_Launch_AdvancedBallistic</launchProjectile>
    <slots>
      <li>Warhead</li>
      <li>Guidance</li>
      <li>Payload</li>
    </slots>
  </DMSE.MissileBodyDef>


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       六、先進巡航導彈（戰斧）— 輕型階（小型導彈）
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <DMSE.MissileBodyDef>
    <defName>DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedCruise</defName>
    <label>advanced cruise missile body</label>
    <description>A modern low-observable cruise missile airframe in the class of the Tomahawk. Terrain-following, datalinked and far more accurate than the Scorer chassis it supersedes, with the full four slots: warhead, guidance, propulsion and payload.</description>
    <sizeClass>Light</sizeClass>
    <launchMode>Both</launchMode>
    <customizeLocation>Item</customizeLocation>
    <!-- N = 6：高於現役輕型（N=3）與現役中型（N=5） -->
    <payloadCapacity>6</payloadCapacity>
    <baseExplosionRadius>6.5</baseExplosionRadius>
    <baseDamageDef>Bomb</baseDamageDef>
    <baseDamageAmount>130</baseDamageAmount>
    <baseScatter>2</baseScatter>
    <baseWorldSpeedFactor>1.15</baseWorldSpeedFactor>
    <!-- 射程：115 * 3.4 * 0.1 = 39.1 → 39 格（現役中型 30） -->
    <baseRange>0</baseRange>
    <terminalUpdates>4</terminalUpdates>
    <baseFuel>115</baseFuel>
    <baseSpecificImpulse>3.4</baseSpecificImpulse>
    <rangePerFuelImpulse>0.1</rangePerFuelImpulse>
    <assembleWorkAmount>900</assembleWorkAmount>
    <incomingSkyfaller>DMSE_Incoming_AdvancedCruiseMissile</incomingSkyfaller>
    <launchProjectile>DMSE_Launch_AdvancedCruise</launchProjectile>
    <slots>
      <li>Warhead</li>
      <li>Guidance</li>
      <li>Propulsion</li>
      <li>Payload</li>
    </slots>
    <!-- 建造時自帶：材料已含在物品 costList 內。 -->
    <defaultParts>
      <li>DMSE_AdvCruise_Warhead_Penetrator</li>
      <li>DMSE_AdvCruise_Guidance_TerrainMatch</li>
      <li>DMSE_AdvCruise_Propulsion_Turbofan</li>
      <li>DMSE_AdvCruise_Payload_None</li>
    </defaultParts>
  </DMSE.MissileBodyDef>


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       七、輕型防空導彈（刺針）— 輕型階，兩槽，攔截彈與單兵發射具彈藥
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <DMSE.MissileBodyDef>
    <defName>DMSE_MissileBody_Stinger</defName>
    <label>light surface-to-air missile body</label>
    <description>A slim man-portable infrared surface-to-air airframe with only two assembly slots, warhead and guidance. Short-ranged and light-headed, and as an interceptor somewhat less accurate than a full-size surface-to-air round, but small enough to fit any magazine or a soldier's pack.</description>
    <sizeClass>Light</sizeClass>
    <launchMode>Both</launchMode>
    <customizeLocation>Item</customizeLocation>
    <payloadCapacity>3</payloadCapacity>
    <baseExplosionRadius>3</baseExplosionRadius>
    <baseDamageDef>Bomb</baseDamageDef>
    <baseDamageAmount>60</baseDamageAmount>
    <baseScatter>2</baseScatter>
    <baseWorldSpeedFactor>0.85</baseWorldSpeedFactor>
    <!-- 射程：70 * 3.0 * 0.1 = 21 格 -->
    <baseRange>0</baseRange>
    <terminalUpdates>1</terminalUpdates>
    <baseFuel>70</baseFuel>
    <baseSpecificImpulse>3</baseSpecificImpulse>
    <rangePerFuelImpulse>0.1</rangePerFuelImpulse>
    <assembleWorkAmount>600</assembleWorkAmount>
    <!-- 小彈頭、紅外導引頭對高速目標吃力：攔截命中率 ×0.85 -->
    <interceptHitFactor>0.85</interceptHitFactor>
    <incomingSkyfaller>DMSE_Incoming_Stinger</incomingSkyfaller>
    <launchProjectile>DMSE_Launch_Stinger</launchProjectile>
    <slots>
      <li>Warhead</li>
      <li>Guidance</li>
    </slots>
    <defaultParts>
      <li>DMSE_Light_Warhead_HE</li>
      <li>DMSE_Light_Guidance_IR</li>
    </defaultParts>
  </DMSE.MissileBodyDef>


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       八、對地攻擊導彈（小牛）— 輕型階，三槽
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <DMSE.MissileBodyDef>
    <defName>DMSE_MissileBody_Maverick</defName>
    <label>ground-attack missile body</label>
    <description>A light ground-attack airframe in the class of the Maverick, built to put a heavier warhead on one specific point target. Three assembly slots: warhead, guidance and payload.</description>
    <sizeClass>Light</sizeClass>
    <launchMode>Both</launchMode>
    <customizeLocation>Item</customizeLocation>
    <payloadCapacity>4</payloadCapacity>
    <baseExplosionRadius>4.5</baseExplosionRadius>
    <baseDamageDef>Bomb</baseDamageDef>
    <baseDamageAmount>110</baseDamageAmount>
    <baseScatter>2.5</baseScatter>
    <baseWorldSpeedFactor>0.85</baseWorldSpeedFactor>
    <!-- 射程：80 * 3.0 * 0.1 = 24 格 -->
    <baseRange>0</baseRange>
    <terminalUpdates>2</terminalUpdates>
    <baseFuel>80</baseFuel>
    <baseSpecificImpulse>3</baseSpecificImpulse>
    <rangePerFuelImpulse>0.1</rangePerFuelImpulse>
    <assembleWorkAmount>900</assembleWorkAmount>
    <incomingSkyfaller>DMSE_Incoming_Maverick</incomingSkyfaller>
    <launchProjectile>DMSE_Launch_Maverick</launchProjectile>
    <slots>
      <li>Warhead</li>
      <li>Guidance</li>
      <li>Payload</li>
    </slots>
    <defaultParts>
      <li>DMSE_Light_Warhead_HE</li>
      <li>DMSE_Light_Guidance_IR</li>
      <li>DMSE_Light_Payload_None</li>
    </defaultParts>
  </DMSE.MissileBodyDef>


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       九、先進防空導彈（麻雀）— 輕型階，三槽，半主動攔截彈
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <DMSE.MissileBodyDef>
    <defName>DMSE_MissileBody_Sparrow</defName>
    <label>advanced surface-to-air missile body</label>
    <description>A slender semi-active radar-homing airframe that keeps receiving the illuminator's signal through hard manoeuvres. As an interceptor it is markedly more accurate than older rounds. Three assembly slots: warhead, guidance and payload.</description>
    <sizeClass>Light</sizeClass>
    <launchMode>Both</launchMode>
    <customizeLocation>Item</customizeLocation>
    <payloadCapacity>4</payloadCapacity>
    <baseExplosionRadius>4</baseExplosionRadius>
    <baseDamageDef>Bomb</baseDamageDef>
    <baseDamageAmount>90</baseDamageAmount>
    <baseScatter>1.5</baseScatter>
    <baseWorldSpeedFactor>1</baseWorldSpeedFactor>
    <!-- 射程：85 * 3.4 * 0.1 = 28.9 → 29 格 -->
    <baseRange>0</baseRange>
    <terminalUpdates>2</terminalUpdates>
    <baseFuel>85</baseFuel>
    <baseSpecificImpulse>3.4</baseSpecificImpulse>
    <rangePerFuelImpulse>0.1</rangePerFuelImpulse>
    <assembleWorkAmount>900</assembleWorkAmount>
    <!-- 半主動雷達導引：攔截命中率 ×1.25 -->
    <interceptHitFactor>1.25</interceptHitFactor>
    <incomingSkyfaller>DMSE_Incoming_Sparrow</incomingSkyfaller>
    <launchProjectile>DMSE_Launch_Sparrow</launchProjectile>
    <slots>
      <li>Warhead</li>
      <li>Guidance</li>
      <li>Payload</li>
    </slots>
    <defaultParts>
      <li>DMSE_Light_Warhead_ContinuousRod</li>
      <li>DMSE_Light_Guidance_SemiActive</li>
      <li>DMSE_Light_Payload_None</li>
    </defaultParts>
  </DMSE.MissileBodyDef>


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       十、超音速反艦導彈（白蛉）— 中型階，四槽
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <DMSE.MissileBodyDef>
    <defName>DMSE_MissileBody_Moskit</defName>
    <label>supersonic anti-ship missile body</label>
    <description>A ramjet-powered supersonic airframe that climbs after launch and dives to skim the sea, compressing a close-in defence's reaction time to seconds. Four assembly slots: warhead, guidance, propulsion and payload; it leaves the printer with an anti-ship radar seeker.</description>
    <sizeClass>Medium</sizeClass>
    <launchMode>Both</launchMode>
    <customizeLocation>Item</customizeLocation>
    <payloadCapacity>5</payloadCapacity>
    <baseExplosionRadius>6</baseExplosionRadius>
    <baseDamageDef>Bomb</baseDamageDef>
    <baseDamageAmount>140</baseDamageAmount>
    <baseScatter>3</baseScatter>
    <baseWorldSpeedFactor>1.35</baseWorldSpeedFactor>
